>
> Best effort: the sudo log does not show \`sudo -E\` or where one argument ends and the next begins, so a command shown as allowed can still be refused in enforce.


|  |  |
|:--|:--|
| 🚨 **Bypass attempts** | **2 hosts would be blocked** |
