| Host | What happened | Tries |
|:--|:--|--:|
| \`front.example.org\` | 🎭 **Host/SNI mismatch** (domain fronting), not blocked (analyze)<br><sub>sent inside TLS for \`cdn.jsdelivr.net\` · dialled \`151.101.1.229\`</sub> | 1 |
| \`imds.example.org\` | 🕳️ **Internal address** → \`169.254.169.254\` (cloud metadata service), would be refused | 1 |

### 🚫 Not on the allowlist (3) — would be blocked

| Host | Seen as | Tries |
|:--|:--|--:|
| \`exfil.example.net\` | HTTPS (SNI) · DNS also refused | 2 |
| \`gist.githubusercontent.com\` | on the risky-subdomain denylist | 1 |
| \`pypi.example.com\` | plain HTTP | 1 |

### 🔒 Refused by \`http-filter\` (2) — would be blocked

